<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Gets a local player variable sVarName on the specified object.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>All local variables must be predefined in the target object's variables 2da file before this function can be used successfully. If a local variable is not predefined this function will fail silently.
</p><p>It is very important to note that a player is not a reference to a specific player, but rather is a reference to a player slot (player1, player2, player3... etc) so the values will not necessarily refer to the same players across a save/load.
</p>
